### 7. Unsupported event type (will be ignored)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/github
Content-Type: application/json
X-GitHub-Event: issues
X-GitHub-Delivery: 12345-67894-abcdef
X-Hub-Signature-256: sha256=your_signature_here

{
  "action": "opened",
  "issue": {
    "id": 1,
    "number": 1,
    "title": "Found a bug"
  }
}

